{"id":1463,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为拓宽优质生源渠道、持续提升生源质量，2026年6月23日至26日，中北大学经济与管理学院组建专项招生宣传队伍，由院党委副书记崔媛带队赴大同市开展系列高考招生宣讲活动。本次宣传面向大同本地考生与家长，全方位解读学校办学特色、专业布局、招生政策，同步提供志愿填报专业指导。 </p><p>宣传期间，宣讲团队先后走进大同市第一中学、同煤二中、馨茂中学、同煤一中、广灵一中、云州区一中等多所当地重点中学。通过专场招生宣讲、发放宣传手册、现场一对一答疑等多种形式，与考生、家长开展深度面对面交流。宣讲老师系统介绍了中北大学深厚办学底蕴、优质师资队伍、完善学科体系与良好就业发展前景，清晰解答大家关心的报考疑问，帮助考生和家长精准把握报考要点，树立清晰的志愿填报思路。</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GU4lfYLRCbUN-DMkmQfLNLYLmLZLRWRfMmW7Uz-sLzTVnmL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hVokyYUSyZL467U49aLmARLR-aLRf7L7CYM4TRn7M2L8rFMR-PMmlYL4AFLmN8U4lJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-8MRvbgtA8pU7cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=24479&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BE82A837DC8028C02000D0F279CDCF3E/42165238/294C5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 435px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GU4lfYLRCbUN-DMkmQfLNLYLmLZLRWRfMmW7Uz-sLzTVnmL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hVokyYUSyZL467U49aLmARLR-aLRf7L7CYM4TRn7M2L8rFMR-PMmlYL4AFLmN8U4lJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-8MRvbgtA8pU7cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=24479&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GolCfan7V2oRAVMkzf7MzTRUlCaoR7RanzNsoRNbnNCPLml0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy4LYhVokyYnzVVnzLaMlMfM4f7M7VRMN7aoz7iL7WRoz6FolCPoRNso7nFoRl4nmCJqjfjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-8MRvbgtA8pU7cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=24479&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C33E82E1EE305CA70D4AC6A09150BC97/9F18978D/853F6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 439px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GMN7f4L7L4ol-ZLkmG4Uml4Uz7ZLm-RiMmvaLlL8LN-sUmN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy8U1y8n1hfMRn2UlWRUzvYnzLanR7sn7-sLN-ZozVkLNrFLR98nmv4LRAFM7Q7L77YgtXaQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG8M1yYMRUsoSbw6278c&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=24479&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GU4VfkU8L8M4LbLkl-ZoRr7M8WfMzrRVUmV7L4WfnRGaozv0gihFp2hmCIa0okh2MSy4oSyPLNUPLN-DLzCZMRGsoRl4MRQkMR-4Lm-DLmAFUzWknR7PUmVFMR7sLRLJqjfjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-8MRvbgtA8pU7cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=24479&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8F53912D12B616840785346B42322628